        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Highlight members, lead singer of the band that released \"Zig-Zag Walk\"\n- Bands: Highlight, the band that released \"Zig-Zag Walk\"\n- Songs: \"Zig-Zag Walk\"\n- Events: 1983 release, April 2016 departure\n\nFacts:\n- The song \"Zig-Zag Walk\" was released in 1983 by a band whose lead singer was born before a singer who was later in Highlight.\n- A singer who was a member of Highlight was born after that lead singer of the band associated with \"Zig-Zag Walk.\"\n- That Highlight singer left the group in April 2016.",
