        "original_id": "aa2a3c69-0de7-5512-85d4-3c1040835d9b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Peverett, Jang Hyun-seung, Erik Cartwright\n- Bands: Foghat, Savoy Brown, Highlight\n- Albums: Zig-Zag Walk, In the Mood for Something Rude\n\nFacts:\n- Dave Peverett was born on 16 April 1943 and died on 7 February 2000.\n- Dave Peverett was an English singer and musician also known as Lonesome Dave.\n- Dave Peverett became best known as the original lead vocalist and rhythm guitarist of Foghat, which he founded after his time in Savoy Brown.\n- Jang Hyun-seung was born on September 3, 1989 and is a South Korean singer most often credited as Hyunseung.\n- In the album Zig-Zag Walk, Dave Peverett wrote five of the ten songs, unlike the previous year's In the Mood for Something Rude, which consisted entirely of outside material.\n- In the album Zig-Zag Walk, Erik Cartwright contributed a sixth song.\n- Jang Hyun-seung, an original member of Highlight, officially left the group in April 2016.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
